1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:02,249
Imagine a machine…

2
00:00:02,299 --> 00:00:04,364
that could give you

3
00:00:04,414 --> 00:00:06,102
a perfect life.

4
00:00:07,769 --> 00:00:09,444
Every dream.

5
00:00:09,494 --> 00:00:11,276
Every success.

6
00:00:11,326 --> 00:00:12,890
Every love.

7
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:14,540
All of it…

8
00:00:14,590 --> 00:00:16,330
perfectly felt.

9
00:00:16,755 --> 00:00:18,422
There's only one thing.

10
00:00:18,472 --> 00:00:19,879
None of it

11
00:00:19,929 --> 00:00:21,383
would be real.

12
00:00:21,812 --> 00:00:22,824
On one side,

13
00:00:22,874 --> 00:00:24,950
a life where nothing

14
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,277
ever goes wrong.

15
00:00:26,327 --> 00:00:27,958
On the other…

16
00:00:28,008 --> 00:00:30,084
a life that rains.

17
00:00:30,134 --> 00:00:31,591
That hurts.

18
00:00:31,641 --> 00:00:33,578
That's true.

19
00:00:34,136 --> 00:00:36,217
Here, every smile

20
00:00:36,267 --> 00:00:37,526
is guaranteed.

21
00:00:37,576 --> 00:00:40,296
There, every smile

22
00:00:40,346 --> 00:00:41,298
is earned…

23
00:00:41,348 --> 00:00:44,178
or maybe just lucky.

24
00:00:44,554 --> 00:00:45,989
And if you could never

25
00:00:46,039 --> 00:00:47,261
tell the difference…

26
00:00:47,311 --> 00:00:49,345
would it matter?

27
00:00:51,498 --> 00:00:52,339
Do you want

28
00:00:52,389 --> 00:00:53,871
to be happy…

29
00:00:53,921 --> 00:00:55,238
or do you want it

30
00:00:55,288 --> 00:00:56,780
to be true?

